---
---
<section id="how" class="py-24 bg-ocean-900 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">We Clone Your Best Days</h2>
            <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-neon mx-auto"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 relative">
            <!-- Connecting Line (Desktop) -->
            <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-full h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-neon/30 to-transparent -translate-y-1/2 z-0"></div>

            <!-- Step 1 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 bg-ocean-950 p-8 border border-white/5 rounded-sm hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-ocean-900 border border-neon text-neon flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl mb-6 mx-auto shadow-glow-sm">1</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-3">It Rings (Or Pings)</h3>
                <p class="text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">Whether it's a phone call, SMS, or Instagram DM, we pick up instantly. 24/7 coverage. No sick days.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 bg-ocean-950 p-8 border border-white/5 rounded-sm hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-ocean-900 border border-neon text-neon flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl mb-6 mx-auto shadow-glow-sm">2</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-3">It Chats & Qualifies</h3>
                <p class="text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">Our AI sounds like your best apprentice. Friendly, local, and focused on getting the details (Name, Issue, Location).</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 3 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 bg-ocean-950 p-8 border border-white/5 rounded-sm hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-ocean-900 border border-neon text-neon flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl mb-6 mx-auto shadow-glow-sm">3</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-3">It Books or Escalates</h3>
                <p class="text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">If it's a qualified lead, it goes straight into your calendar. If it's urgent/complex, we text you immediately.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
